# Code-block tools CI installs before `cargo test`, checked with `sha256sum --strict -c` (comment
# lines stripped first). A mismatch fails the job. Each sum is the project's published one,
# cross-checked against a local download on 2026-11-04.
#
# shfmt v3.14.1
#   binary: https://github.com/mvdan/sh/releases/download/v3.14.1/shfmt_v3.14.1_linux_amd64
#   sum:    the release publishes no checksum file; this is the asset digest GitHub publishes
#           for it, https://api.github.com/repos/mvdan/sh/releases/tags/v3.14.1 (assets[].digest)
# ruff 0.17.3
#   tarball: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases/download/0.17.3/ruff-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
