#   sum:    the hadolint-linux-x86_64 line of https://github.com/hadolint/hadolint/releases/download/v2.15.1/checksums.sha256
#           (the same as GitHub's asset digest for it; cross-checked against a local download on 2026-11-10)
#
# dockerfmt v0.6.0
