#           a local download on 2026-11-10)
#
# Go 1.27.3 (gofmt and go vet; actions/setup-go does not verify toolchain checksums)
#   tarball: https://go.dev/dl/go1.27.3.linux-amd64.tar.gz
#   sum:     the sha256 for go1.27.3.linux-amd64.tar.gz in https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json
#
# Node 24.22.2 (the 24.x LTS; runs prettier and eslint, which eslint 10 needs Node ^20.19 / ^22.13 / >=24 for)
#   tarball: https://nodejs.org/dist/v24.22.2/node-v24.22.2-linux-x64.tar.xz
#   sum:     the node-v24.22.2-linux-x64.tar.xz line of https://nodejs.org/dist/v24.22.2/SHASUMS256.txt
#
# yamllint is pinned with hashes in ci/requirements-yamllint.txt.
# black is pinned with hashes in ci/requirements-black.txt.
# pylint is pinned with hashes in ci/requirements-pylint.txt.
# prettier and eslint are pinned by the integrity hashes in ci/node-tools/package-lock.json.
